[0.606, "o", "# A gated tool call through the LangChain adapter, start to finish\r\n\r\n"]
[1.005, "o", ">>> policy.register_action('check_loan_eligibility', 'irreversible_financial')\r\n"]
[1.107, "o", "    (no default allowed here — this must be declared explicitly)\r\n\r\n"]
[1.312, "o", ">>> agent calls check_loan_eligibility('A123')...\r\n"]
[1.024, "o", "  >> GATE TRIGGERED: 'check_loan_eligibility' classified as high risk\r\n"]
[1.301, "o", "     routing to compliance_officer for approval...\r\n"]
[1.402, "o", "     compliance_officer: reviewing applicant A123's request...\r\n"]
[1.405, "o", "     compliance_officer: APPROVED\r\n\r\n"]
[1.209, "o", "<<< tool result: Applicant A123: eligible\r\n\r\n"]
[1.307, "o", ">>> audit record written (append-only, Art. 12):\r\n"]
[1.105, "o", "    action=check_loan_eligibility  risk_tier=high  confidence=1.0\r\n"]
[1.104, "o", "    exposure_class=irreversible_financial\r\n"]
[1.104, "o", "    approver=compliance_officer  approved=True\r\n\r\n"]
[1.605, "o", ">>> generating a conformity readiness checklist from this audit trail...\r\n\r\n"]
[1.206, "o", "# Conformity readiness checklist (pre-assessment aid)\r\n\r\n> This is a gap-analysis against logged evidence, not a conformity assessment — it doesn't determine whether the system actually conforms, only whether the supporting evidence this generator can see is in place.\r\n\r\n- [x] **Audit trail covers logged actions** (Art. 12) — 1 action(s) logged\r\n- [x] **Risk classification applied to high-risk actions** (Art. 6, Annex III) — Risk tiers observed: high\r\n- [x] **Human oversight gates configured for high-risk actions** (Art. 14) — 1 gated action(s) logged\r\n- [x] **Override decisions carry a recorded reason** (Art. 14) — 0 override(s) logged\r\n- [x] **System description documented** (Annex IV) — Provided via questionnaire\r\n- [x] **Data governance summary documented** (Annex IV) — Provided via questionnaire\r\n- [ ] **Post-market monitoring plan drafted** (Art. 72) — Run generate_post_market_monitoring_plan() and confirm here\r\n- [ ] **Fundamental Rights Impact Assessment drafted (if applicable)** (Art."]
[0.000, "o", " 27) — Run generate_fria() if this system is a banking/insurance/public-service deployer\r\n\r\n**2 gap(s) found** — see unchecked items above.\r\n"]
